  "ability.mount_is": "Mount: {0}",
  "itemdesc.thoritem": "The hammer calls a series of lightning bolts. If Greed are on screen, the bolts target them: small Greed die in one hit, big ones take heavy damage. Your subjects are safe. Tip: let the Greed pile up against a wall before using it.",
  "itemdesc.helitem": "Hel's trophy summons a squad of ghostly viking raiders: a berserker and four archers who follow you and attack everything in front of them, portals included, until they expire.",
  "itemdesc.heimdalitem": "The horn creates an entry portal on the first blow, then an exit portal on the second. Your subjects use it when it gets them there faster. Beware, the Greed can use it too.",
  "itemdesc.lokiitem": "The staff turns you into a Greed: the Greed ignore you, but your subjects attack you and fall back behind the walls. Use the ability again to return to your form. Taking a hit breaks the illusion.",
  "itemdesc.artemisbow": "Artemis's bow fires a powerful attack in one direction, at several targets. You stay still while aiming.",
  "itemdesc.hephaestushammer": "Hephaestus's hammer places an anvil that powers up nearby fighters: they then set enemies on fire.",
  "itemdesc.medusashield": "Athena's shield breathes a mist in front of you that petrifies every living being for a day: Greed, animals, and your own subjects too. Big Greed stay petrified for less time. Using it again frees the petrified, and hitting a petrified being frees it too. 5 second cooldown. Needed to get Pegasus.",
  "steeddesc.griffin": "Fast, good stamina. Eats rats anywhere to recover. Ability: a wing beat that pushes small Greed back.",
  "steeddesc.warhorse": "Slow, low stamina. When galloping, gives nearby subjects temporary protection.",
  "steeddesc.stag": "Faster in forests. Lures wild deer, which your archers hunt for coins.",
  "steeddesc.lizard": "Low stamina, recovers by basking in the sun. Ability: spits fire at enemies.",
  "steeddesc.bear": "Low stamina. Ability: a charge that kills small Greed and animals.",
  "steeddesc.unicorn": "Faster on plains. Produces coins after grazing.",
  "steeddesc.sleipnir": "Fast. Ability: knocks Greed back when charging and leaves a trail of fire.",
  "steeddesc.gullinbursti": "Very slow, low stamina. Digs up coins and boosts farms.",
  "steeddesc.daynight": "Heimdall's horse, high stamina. Faster at dawn and dusk, changes colour with the time of day. Needed for Heimdall's puzzle.",
  "steeddesc.wolf": "Fast. Howls at the moon, outside the forest, to recover. Ability: a charge and a defensive buff for your troops.",
  "steeddesc.chimera": "Ability: a fiery charge that sets the Greed on fire. Effective, but puts you in the thick of the fight.",
  "steeddesc.spider": "Slow, faster in forests, feeds in the forest. Ability: drops webs that slow the Greed down.",
  "state.playertransformed": "you are transformed into a Greed",
  "state.staffspawned": "the staff has appeared",
  "state.staffpickedup": "staff taken",
  "puzzle.loki_howto": "your crown must fall into the statue's hands, within {0} of it. Empty your purse, keep two or three coins, stand in the middle of the shrine facing your camp, and let a Greed hit you, preferably during the day. Danger: if a Greed picks up the crown, the reign ends",
